{"entries":[{"id":"lex:A1:yellow","headword":"yellow","goals":["everyday","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:yellow","pos":"adjective","gloss":"زرد","meaning":"رنگِ لیمو و خورشید. صفت است و جمع بسته نمی‌شود؛ اسمِ رنگ هم هست: Yellow is my favourite colour.","grammar":[{"pattern":"yellow + noun","note":"a yellow bag"},{"pattern":"be yellow","note":"زرد بودن"},{"pattern":"light / dark yellow","note":"زردِ روشن / تیره"}],"examples":[{"en":"I love yellow flowers.","fa":"گل‌های زرد را دوست دارم."},{"en":"She painted her room yellow.","fa":"اتاقش را زرد رنگ کرد."}],"collocations":["bright yellow","a yellow dress","yellow flowers","light yellow"],"mistake":{"wrong":"My car is yellow colour.","right":"My car is yellow.","why":"بعد از be خودِ رنگ کافی است؛ colour لازم نیست."},"pronunciation":{"gb":"/ˈjeləʊ/","us":"/ˈjeloʊ/"},"check":[{"type":"cloze","id":"c1","text":"The sun is ___ and the sky is blue.","answer":"yellow","accept":["orange"],"fa":"خورشید زرد است و آسمان آبی.","why":"yellow = زرد."},{"type":"choice","id":"q1","prompt":"Her new car is ___.","options":[{"text":"yellow","ok":true,"why":"بعد از is خودِ رنگ می‌آید."},{"text":"yellows","ok":false,"why":"صفت جمع بسته نمی‌شود."},{"text":"yellow colour","ok":false,"why":"colour لازم نیست."}]},{"type":"produce","id":"p1","prompt":"کیفِ زردم را دیدی؟","frame":"Have you seen my ___ bag?","answer":"yellow","accept":[],"why":"yellow + اسم."}]}],"version":"53c394932438","order":800,"released":false},{"id":"lex:A1:actress","headword":"actress","goals":["everyday","general"],"senses":[{"id":"lex:A1:actress","pos":"noun","gloss":"بازیگر زن","meaning":"زنی که در فیلم یا تئاتر بازی می‌کند. با صدای «اَ» شروع می‌شود، پس an actress. امروزه خیلی‌ها برای زن هم actor می‌گویند.","grammar":[{"pattern":"an actress","note":"با an"},{"pattern":"a famous actress","note":"بازیگر مشهور"},{"pattern":"actor / actress","note":"بازیگر / بازیگر زن"}],"examples":[{"en":"She's a famous actress in Iran.","fa":"او بازیگرِ مشهوری در ایران است."},{"en":"T